# Staged deployable copy of the mod (dll + yamls) — build output, not source.
# This used to be `mod/`, back when the built DLL was dropped next to the
# yamls at the repo root. In the monorepo `mod/` holds the tracked mod assets
# and staging goes to dist/, so ignoring `mod/` would hide real sources.
dist/
